OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker presents an
OL,12,     Fafternoon of exclusive
OL,13,     Fmusic-making, with recordings from
OL,14,     Fthe Royal Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,15,     Fand chamber music from St. Magnus
OL,16,     FFestival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,18,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,19,     FBarber's final years when he was
OL,20,     Fsuffering from alcoholism,
OL,21,     Fdepression and cancer.
